Revision history for Kembec-SunatSdk

Unreleased

0.000999_007  (SDK 0.1.0-beta.7, not released to CPAN)
    - send, summary, ticket and status results carry `diagnosis`: for each code of the answer, the input field that
      may have caused it (Kembec::SunatSdk::Diagnosis, DiagnosisDetail, DiagnosisField).

0.000999_006  (SDK 0.1.0-beta.6, not released to CPAN)
    - Version bump with the SDK; no change to the binding.

0.000999_005  (SDK 0.1.0-beta.5, not released to CPAN)
    - First version: every command of the SDK's contract over its C ABI with FFI::Platypus, with the native library
      for Linux x64 and ARM64 (glibc 2.17+), macOS Intel and Apple Silicon, and 64-bit Windows inside.
